<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>For Piyush 🤍</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff1f6, #f8e1eb, #fff8fb);
        color: #4a2635;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .hearts {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        overflow: hidden;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    .heart {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -40px;
        font-size: 22px;
        opacity: 0;
        animation: floatUp linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes floatUp {
        0% {
            transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
            opacity: 0;
        }

        20% {
            opacity: 0.55;
        }

        100% {
            transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
            opacity: 0;
        }
    }

    .page {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 25px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }

    .card {
        width: min(92%, 620px);
        padding: 42px 28px;
        text-align: center;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-radius: 28px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(100,50,70,0.15);
        animation: appear 0.6s ease;
    }

    @keyframes appear {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(15px) scale(0.98);
        }

        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
        }
    }

    .small {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #a65c78;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: clamp(38px, 9vw, 62px);
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: clamp(27px, 7vw, 36px);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .subtitle {
        color: #765362;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    button {
        border: none;
        background: #7d4058;
        color: white;
        padding: 14px 25px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 15px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: 0.25s ease;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(125,64,88,0.22);
    }

    button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        background: #663247;
    }

    button:active {
        transform: scale(0.97);
    }

    .hidden {
        display: none;
    }

    .message {
        text-align: left;
        background: rgba(255,245,248,0.9);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin: 25px 0;
    }

    .reasons {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 25px 0;
    }

    .reason {
        background: white;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 16px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(80,40,55,0.06);
    }

    .photo-box {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 190px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin: 22px 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5dce5, #f9eaf0);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        color: #8c6070;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .photo-box img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
    }

    .final {
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    .signature {
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 18px;
    }

    .tiny {
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #9a7885;
    }

    .big-heart {
        font-size: 70px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes heartbeat {
        0%, 100% {
            transform: scale(1);
        }

        50% {
            transform: scale(1.12);
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Floating hearts -->
<div class="hearts">
    <span class="heart" style="left:7%; animation-duration:9s;">♡</span>
    <span class="heart" style="left:18%; animation-duration:12s; animation-delay:2s;">♥</span>
    <span class="heart" style="left:32%; animation-duration:10s; animation-delay:4s;">♡</span>
    <span class="heart" style="left:48%; animation-duration:13s; animation-delay:1s;">♥</span>
    <span class="heart" style="left:63%; animation-duration:9s; animation-delay:3s;">♡</span>
    <span class="heart" style="left:78%; animation-duration:11s;">♥</span>
    <span class="heart" style="left:91%; animation-duration:14s; animation-delay:2s;">♡</span>
</div>


<div class="page">

    <!-- SCREEN 1 -->
    <div class="card" id="screen1">

        <div class="small">A tiny surprise for you</div>

        <h1>Hey Piyush 👀</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            I made something for you.<br>
            And yes... you're actually going to have to click the button.
        </p>

        <button onclick="nextScreen(2)">
            Okay... let's see 🤭
        </button>

        <div class="tiny">
            P.S. I spent actual time making this, so behave. 😭
        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- SCREEN 2 -->
    <div class="card hidden" id="screen2">

        <div class="small">Plot twist</div>

        <h2>
            You actually clicked it. 😭
        </h2>

        <p class="subtitle">
            Since you're already here,
            I might as well tell you why I made this.
        </p>

        <button onclick="nextScreen(3)">
            I'm listening →
        </button>

    </div>


    <!-- SCREEN 3 -->
    <div class="card hidden" id="screen3">

        <div class="small">For Piyush</div>

        <h2>Happy Boyfriend Day 🤍</h2>

        <div class="message">

            <p>
                I could've just sent you a normal message,
                but that would've been way too boring.
            </p>

            <br>

            <p>
                So here's my slightly dramatic and unnecessarily
                complicated way of saying that I'm really glad
                you're a part of my life.
            </p>

            <br>

            <p>
                You somehow manage to make ordinary conversations,
                random moments and even the most boring days
                a little more fun.
            </p>

            <br>

            <p>
                And yes, you can be annoying.
                Very annoying, actually. 😭
                But unfortunately, you're still pretty special.
            </p>

        </div>

        <button onclick="nextScreen(4)">
            There's more? 👀
        </button>

    </div>


    <!-- SCREEN 4 -->
    <div class="card hidden" id="screen4">

        <div class="small">A few things</div>

        <h2>Things I appreciate about you</h2>

        <div class="reasons">

            <div class="reason">
                ♡ You make me laugh when I don't expect it.
            </div>

            <div class="reason">
                ♡ You make random conversations interesting.
            </div>

            <div class="reason">
                ♡ You remember little things.
            </div>

            <div class="reason">
                ♡ I can be myself around you.
            </div>

            <div class="reason">
                ♡ And somehow you still tolerate me. 😭
            </div>

        </div>

        <button onclick="nextScreen(5)">
            One last thing →
        </button>

    </div>


    <!-- SCREEN 5 -->
    <div class="card hidden" id="screen5">

        <div class="small">One last thing</div>

        <h2>Before you go...</h2>

        <div class="photo-box">

            <!--
            If you want to add a photo later:

            1. Upload your photo to this same GitHub repository.
            2. Name it photo.jpg
            3. Delete the text below.
            4. Put this instead:

            <img src="photo.jpg" alt="A favourite memory">

            -->

            <span>
                📷<br><br>
                Your favourite photo can go here.
            </span>

        </div>

        <p class="final">

            I don't need a special day to appreciate you,

            <br>

            but since today gives me an excuse...

            <br><br>

            <strong>Happy Boyfriend Day, Piyush. 🤍</strong>

            <br><br>

            Stay exactly as wonderfully annoying as you are.

        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            — from someone who definitely didn't spend too much time making this 🤭
        </div>

        <br><br>

        <button onclick="nextScreen(6)">
            Wait... one secret 👀
        </button>

    </div>


    <!-- SCREEN 6 -->
    <div class="card hidden" id="screen6">

        <div class="small">Secret unlocked</div>

        <div class="big-heart">
            ♡
        </div>

        <h2>Okay, NOW we're done.</h2>

        <p class="final">

            Unless you want another website
            every time there's a special day. 😭

            <br><br>

            <strong>Happy Boyfriend Day, Piyush 🤍</strong>

        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            Don't forget who made this. 😌
        </div>

    </div>

</div>


<script>

function nextScreen(number) {

    document.querySelectorAll(".card").forEach(function(card) {
        card.classList.add("hidden");
    });

    document.getElementById("screen" + number).classList.remove("hidden");

    window.scrollTo({
        top: 0,
        behavior: "smooth"
    });
}

</script>

</body>
</html>
